Title Advice regarding herpes simplex virus (HSV) II infection in a pregnant woman
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Obstetrics > Perinatal infections
() Flag as important','{"A":"28-year-old woman, who is 22 weeks pregnant in her second pregnancy, presents for\nevaluation of a vulval ulcer. The swab taken confirms the diagnosis of herpes simplex type II\n(HSV-II) infection. When she is informed, she becomes quite surprised as neither she nor her\nhusband has ever had this infection before and insists on knowing the source of the infection.\nFurthermore, she is very concerned about her baby’s well-being and asks whether her\ncondition may affect it. Which of the following is the most appropriate advice in this regard?\n\nCJA Most neonates with neonatal herpes present with mucocutaneous lesions.","B":"Although treatment with antiviral agents such as aciclovir will reduce the rate of\nrecurrence of the disease, they cannot be used during pregnancy because of their\nadverse effects on the fetus.","C":"The primary infection is commonly asymptomatic.","D":"Unless she has had a new sexual partner recently, this problem could not have\nbeen acquired sexually.","E":"The risk of neonatal herpes is much higher with recurrent maternal infection\ncompared with primary infection.\n\n| seethecorect option | het tlie"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-4a99777ddeef","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b639cb067a469480a801","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":281,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"b639cb067a469480a801","source_file":"Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","sourc