Title Consultation with and management options of an HCV Ab positive pregnant woman
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Obstetrics > Perinatal infections
() Flag as important
A 27-year-old pregnant woman presents to your practice in the first trimester of her
pregnancy for routine antenatal care. On investigations, she is found to be positive
