Question ID 176
Title Advice regarding contraception after missed contraceptive pills
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Gynecology > Contraception
(Flag as important
A 32-year-old woman comes to your practice because she forgot to take her 7th and gth P pills
from a pack of OCPs containing 20mcg ethinyloestradiol (EO) and had unprotected
intercourse on days 6 and 7. Today is the 10" day of her menstrual cycle. She wants advice
regarding contraception because she does not want to become pregnant. Which one of the
