Question 165
ID
Title Recognizing the cause of heavy irregular periods in a 49-year-old woman
Category Obstetrics / Gynecology > Gynecology > Disorders of the ovaries and oviducts > Abnormal
uterine bleeding > Abnormal uterine bleeding in women of reproductive age
() Flag as important
FontSize; A A A
A 49-year-old woman presents with heavy irregular periods every 2 to 3 months lasting 7-10
